// 按名拨号 localhost：x86 走注入的 drt_resolve（/etc/hosts），C/VM 走 getaddrinfo；
// 同一台机器上三者结果必须一致（端口 1 必拒）。windows 未注入 dns_rt，此样例
// 故意留在 traps 目录（golden-verify/multibackend 只在 Linux 跑，不进跨目标语料）。
// Dial "localhost" by name: x86 resolves via the injected stub resolver from
// /etc/hosts while C/VM use getaddrinfo; on one machine all three must agree
// (port 1 -> refused). Windows has no dns_rt yet, so this sample lives in the
// traps directory (Linux-only golden/multibackend, never the cross-target corpus).
match tcp_dial("localhost", 1) {
    Err(e) => {
        assert(e == "tcp_dial: Connection refused", "localhost refused text mismatch")
        println("localhost refused ok")
    },
    Ok(h) => {
        net_close(h)
        println("unexpected: localhost:1 accepted")
    },
}
